            <p style="margin-top:24px">At Collaborative Construction, we pride ourselves on a professional, client-centered approach. We specialize in residential construction including new construction, additions, accessory dwelling units, demolitions, permitting, and other renovation projects.</p>
            <p>The owner and founder, <span class="owner">Wesleigh Behn</span>, brings over 30 years of experience in the construction field, with extensive expertise in custom home building and renovation projects, as well as years of commercial building experience including dormitories, cannabis dispensaries and grow facilities, athletic facilities, multi-family, and more.</p>
